============================== Start [case_shape_inference,(),{}]
    max_pool2d_1   ['nBS', 64, 7, 7]
    view           ['unk__0', 3136]
    linear         ['unk__0', 1024]
    relu_2         ['unk__0', 1024]
    softmax        ['nBS', 10]
    the Reshape's shape tensor is [-1, 3136]
    -> `nBS` survives conv and pool, then dies at the `-1` of the Reshape and never comes back
    but `softmax` is back to ['nBS', 10], because the exporter *declared* y as ['nBS', 10]
    -> inference treats declared graph I/O as fact; it did not re-derive the batch symbol
       Practical reading: a symbol lost mid-graph is not recoverable by inference alone. If you
       need it back for a TensorRT optimization profile, declare it or rewrite the Reshape.
